   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SICOM-2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka Iraks migrationsstyrning, system f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terintegrering och gr&#xe4;nskontroll. Det omfattar fyra delar: att utveckla Migrationscenter, st&#xe4;rka myndigheters kapacitet inom migration och arbetskraftsr&#xf6;rlighet, st&#xf6;dja digitalisering inom migrationssektorn samt st&#xe4;rka evidensbaserad gr&#xe4;nshantering genom ett nationellt samordningscenter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen Iraq&#x2019;s migration governance, reintegration systems and border control. It consists of four components: developing Migration Centres, enhancing the capacity of authorities in the areas of migration and labour mobility, supporting digitalisation within the migration sector, and strengthening evidence-based border management through a national coordination centre.</narrative>
  </description>
